1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,600
Some days, the hardest part isn't finding an answer.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:08,000
It's explaining what we really feel.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:15,500
Many apps can listen. But who really understands?

4
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:24,200
AI can listen. That doesn't mean it understands.

5
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:33,200
This is Nadia, a fictional adult. She writes: "Sometimes I need time alone."

6
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:39,000
What Sela notices is only an interpretation. Nadia decides: agree, correct or reject.

7
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:45,000
One word can change the meaning. "Sometimes" becomes "always".

8
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:50,200
This mistake is a scripted test fixture, not a real Meta output.

9
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:53,200
Sela's meaning check flags it right away.

10
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:58,600
Nadia corrects it in her own words. Before saving, Sela shows what it will affect.

11
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:01,600
In Sela, a correction is more than a chat edit.

12
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:05,800
The Meaning Integrity Engine traces everything that rests on it.

13
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,400
The summary needs review. Links stop. The request is cancelled.

14
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:14,800
What others already read cannot be recalled.

15
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:19,600
A story doesn't stop at one moment.

16
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Nadia can look back at her notes over time, in her own words.

17
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:35,000
No scores. No diagnosis. This page uses no AI.

18
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:45,000
Understanding is a beginning.

19
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:54,500
If she wants, Nadia picks one small step: writing two questions for a consultation.

20
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:59,400
No reminders, no targets. She can skip it.

21
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:04,000
Her words. Her choice. Her approval.

22
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:13,600
Nadia picks original quotes from her notes. Other notes stay private.

23
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,400
She approves the exact version that will be shared.

24
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:24,600
This is a personal preparation sheet, not a medical record or diagnosis.

25
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:29,400
When Nadia is ready, support follows her terms.

26
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:39,000
In this demo, the recipient is a simulated service. Not a real clinic or practitioner.

27
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:44,600
Nadia can cancel anytime. Copies already viewed cannot be recalled.

28
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:50,200
AI should help us explain our story, not take over its meaning.

29
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:56,000
Your story. Your meaning. Your next step.

30
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:59,500
Sela. Beyond being heard.
